{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:24.377889+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"NONE","body":"The `Array` implementation uses a top-level lru-caching function here:\r\nhttps://github.com/google/jax/blob/0b542ff585b30b24aceadd12a2335b0fa26b8209/jax/_src/array.py#L124\r\n\r\nThere may be other places with similar caches that I didn't go deep enough to dig up... but these would cause some amount of memory growth independent of the jax-specific caching (e.g. anything that would be cleared by `clear_caches`) and a garbage collection would not free these LRU caches either.\r\n\r\nI also tried your test code without the JIT annotation and observed the same linear growth which makes me think that at least that is not the problem... So I experimented a bit.\r\n\r\nIf you replace:\r\n```\r\nres = fn(jnp.zeros(i))\r\n```\r\n\r\n... with:\r\n\r\n```\r\nres = fn(jnp.zeros(5))\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou will still observe some memory growth, but the growth is more stable.\r\n\r\nFor example, I tested by increasing the iteration count to 5000 (larger than the cache limit) and ran it with a fixed array size and got:\r\n```\r\n0.4.24 0.4.24\r\ni=0: 127.640625\r\ni=500: 138.46875\r\ni=1000: 140.53125\r\ni=1500: 140.59375\r\ni=2000: 145.265625\r\ni=2500: 145.28125\r\ni=3000: 147.28125\r\ni=3500: 147.953125\r\ni=4000: 147.953125\r\ni=4500: 147.96875\r\ni=5000: 148.0\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is sort of the behavior you would expect from an LRU cache, so I would only be concerned if the memory growth is unbounded.\r\n\r\nYou mentioned in the other ticket:\r\n\r\n> my model has varying input sizes and needs to reestimate all parameters regularly\r\n\r\nThis would mean you are likely to have a lot of cache misses and would end up fully utilizing the cache space without benefiting much from the cached values.","created_at":"2024-02-16T03:32:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429#issuecomment-1947704010","id":1947704010,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc50F5rK","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1947704010/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-02-17T00:40:11Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1947704010","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7884451?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jacoblubecki","id":7884451,"login":"jacoblubecki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODQ0NTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblubecki","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"It seems like this has been answered. Feel free to open another issue if you still have questions!","created_at":"2024-04-12T22:25:15Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429#issuecomment-2052636531","id":2052636531,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc56WL9z","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2052636531/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-04-12T22:25:15Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2052636531","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nHi there, \r\n\r\n\r\nThe issue was surfaced in Numpyro initially: https://github.com/pyro-ppl/numpyro/issues/1699, it seems all memory is not properly released when allocating a new array in a for loop.\r\n\r\nOne reproducible example:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport jax, jaxlib;\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nimport os\r\nimport psutil\r\nimport gc\r\n\r\nprocess = psutil.Process(os.getpid())\r\n\r\nprint(jax.__version__, jaxlib.__version__)\r\n\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef fn(x):\r\n  return jnp.sum(jnp.sin(x))\r\n\r\nfor i in range(0, 1_001):\r\n    res = fn(jnp.zeros(i))\r\n\r\n    jax.clear_caches()\r\n\r\n    del res\r\n    for x in jax.live_arrays():\r\n        x.delete()\r\n\r\n    gc.collect()\r\n\r\n    if i % 100 == 0:\r\n      print(f\"{i=}: {process.memory_info().rss / 1024 / 1024}\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nGives:\r\n```\r\n0.4.23 0.4.23\r\ni=0: 153.28125\r\ni=100: 179.421875\r\ni=200: 182.40625\r\ni=300: 183.84375\r\ni=400: 186.25\r\ni=500: 187.71875\r\ni=600: 189.703125\r\ni=700: 192.046875\r\ni=800: 194.734375\r\ni=900: 196.890625\r\ni=1000: 198.265625\r\n```\r\n\r\nMore examples are available here: https://github.com/pyro-ppl/numpyro/issues/1699#issuecomment-1877573525\r\n\r\nThanks!\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\n0.4.23, 0.4.23\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nCPU\n\n### Additional system info?\n\n1.26.0 3.10.12 | packaged by conda-forge | (main, Jun 23 2023, 22:41:52) [Clang 15.0.7 ] uname_result(system='Darwin', node='Clements-MacBook-Pro-2.local', release='23.2.0', version='Darwin Kernel Version 23.2.0: Wed Nov 15 21:53:18 PST 2023; root:xnu-10002.61.3~2/RELEASE_ARM64_T6000', machine='arm64')\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n_No response_","closed_at":"2024-04-12T22:25:15Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429/comments","created_at":"2024-01-19T13:27:31Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/19429","id":20905755